    <http://data.europa.eu/a4g/resource/550e9340-a70a-4351-adfe-9376ad6c73b9-01/AwardEvaluationTerm$_ContractAwardNotice1_ProcurementProjectLot1_TenderingTerms1_AwardingTerms1_AwardingCriterion1>,
