  epo:usesTechnique <http://data.europa.eu/a4g/resource/550e9340-a70a-4351-adfe-9376ad6c73b9-01/AuctionTerms$_ContractAwardNotice1_ProcurementProjectLot2_TenderingProcess1_AuctionTerms1>,
